<h1>Sign-up attempt</h1>
<p>Hi <%= @user.first_name %>, someone tried to create an account with this email, but you already have one.</p>
<p><a href="<%= @login_url %>">Log in to my account</a></p>
<p style="color:#666;font-size:13px">Forgot your password? Reset it at <%= @forgot_url %>. If this was not you, you can ignore this email.</p>
